Package: radxa-linkr-debuggerctl
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Suggests: radxa-linkr-debugger-firmware
Description: command-line tools for Radxa Linkr Debugger
 Provides the standalone CLI/TUI, its short rdb command alias, and a desktop
 launcher for controlling Radxa Linkr Debugger hardware.

Package: radxa-linkr-debugger-firmware
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: radxa-linkr-debuggerctl
Description: flashable firmware for Radxa Linkr Debugger
 Provides the combined MCUboot and application UF2 for ROM BOOTSEL recovery and
 the unsigned MCUboot-format application image for OTA updates.
